{"html":"\n\t\t\n<p>As we age, collagen production in our skin naturally decreases, leading to wrinkles, fine lines, and sagging. If you’re looking for a safe, effective way to <a href=\"#/non-surgical-treatments/\">restore youthful skin without surgery</a>, discover Sofwave™ at AestheticEye. Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament, board-certified oculoplastic surgeons, proudly offer this advanced non-invasive skin tightening treatment to patients in Cincinnati and Dayton, OH, using innovative ultrasound technology to stimulate collagen and rejuvenate your skin.</p>\n\n\n<div>\n<figure><a href=\"https://sofwave.com/\"><img src=\"media/5f60c4aeb10f-Sofwave-faviconlogo_Print-CMYK_Black.license-confirmed.png\" alt=\"Sofwave logo featuring stylized blue wave lines on the left and the word “sofwave” in black lowercase letters with a blue circular accent.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"137\"></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-1\">How Sofwave™ Works: The Science Behind Smoother Skin</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Sofwave™ uses proprietary Synchronous Ultrasound Parallel Beam (SUPERB™) technology to deliver ultrasound energy precisely to the mid-dermal layer of the skin. This energy heats the tissue to an optimal temperature, triggering the skin’s natural healing process and stimulating new collagen and elastin production. According to clinical studies, Sofwave™ has shown a 95% patient satisfaction rate for improving fine lines and wrinkles with minimal discomfort and downtime.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <blockquote>\n            <div>Dr. Ginger Henson was a perfect choice for me! She did an excellent job. I had no pain and healed up better than ever! I’m so happy with the job she did for me!</div>\n                            <footer>Lynne S.</footer>\n                        \n        </blockquote>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-2\">Key Benefits of Sofwave™ Skin Tightening</h2>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_b8bae315a45ebbf026606d0b114906c9\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_b8bae315a45ebbf026606d0b114906c9-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Non-Invasive and Safe</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Targets the skin’s deeper layers without incisions, needles, or anesthesia.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_b8bae315a45ebbf026606d0b114906c9-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Fast, Convenient Treatments</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Sessions take just 30-45 minutes, perfect for busy schedules.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_b8bae315a45ebbf026606d0b114906c9-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Minimal Downtime</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Resume normal activities immediately after your appointment.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_b8bae315a45ebbf026606d0b114906c9-column-3\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Proven Results</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Noticeable improvements in skin texture and elasticity within weeks.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_b8bae315a45ebbf026606d0b114906c9-column-4\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>FDA-Cleared</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Sofwave™ is cleared by the FDA for treating fine lines, wrinkles, and lifting the eyebrows, neck, and submental area.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-3\">What Areas Can Sofwave™ Treat?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Sofwave™ is designed to address various skin concerns across multiple areas, including:</p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_f7d02f5350262af9ebb9bbe82aab7bc8\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_f7d02f5350262af9ebb9bbe82aab7bc8-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Forehead and Brows</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Lifts and smooths horizontal lines and drooping brows.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_f7d02f5350262af9ebb9bbe82aab7bc8-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Mid-Face</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Reduces wrinkles around the cheeks and mouth.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_f7d02f5350262af9ebb9bbe82aab7bc8-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Jawline and Neck</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Enhances definition and reduces sagging.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_f7d02f5350262af9ebb9bbe82aab7bc8-column-3\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Décolletage</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Smooths fine lines on the chest.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n<h2 id=\"section-4\">Why Choose Non-Surgical Skin Tightening at AestheticEye in Cincinnati?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>At AestheticEye, Dr.  Henson and Dr.  Pargament provide customized treatment plans to achieve natural, long-lasting results. As  fellowship-trained, board-certified oculoplastic surgeons with extensive experience in both functional and aesthetic procedures around the eyes, Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Pargament understand the intricate anatomy of the face and deliver exceptional, natural-looking outcomes.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We proudly serve patients throughout the Cincinnati and Dayton areas, offering personalized care and advanced treatments that prioritize safety and satisfaction.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-5\">What to Expect During Your Sofwave™ Appointment</h2>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_64c3cfe9011e2a2a1069bc30d75b8cd6\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_64c3cfe9011e2a2a1069bc30d75b8cd6-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>1. Consultation:</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>We’ll evaluate your skin concerns and discuss your goals.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_64c3cfe9011e2a2a1069bc30d75b8cd6-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>2. Preparation:</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>A topical numbing cream may be applied for added comfort.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_64c3cfe9011e2a2a1069bc30d75b8cd6-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>3. Treatment:</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>The Sofwave™ device glides gently across the skin, delivering ultrasound energy to stimulate collagen production.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_64c3cfe9011e2a2a1069bc30d75b8cd6-column-3\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>4. Post-Treatment:</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>There’s no recovery time needed – you can return to your daily activities immediately.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n<p>Most patients notice improvements within a few weeks, with optimal results appearing over three months as new collagen forms.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-6\">Before &amp; After Gallery</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><img src=\"media/85836eaedacc-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0001.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/161356559419-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0002.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/3e5615b80520-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0003.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/7ae0f98aaa83-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0004.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/647464c938ad-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0005.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/b315a3b1e91e-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0006.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/894df36fddc9-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0007.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/6c56b16240f2-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0008.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/46c1f266e888-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0009.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/121cd4704bae-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0010.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/a8c14a0a24d1-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0011.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/e77754e5251e-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0012.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/bf61ad2cad39-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0013.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/92524c33fb37-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0014.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/c3db5c5674b3-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0015.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/50e8339de72a-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0016.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/b21d2060d88d-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0017.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/6d64a5f9385a-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0018.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"media/65b981f5e8d1-Best-of-Before-After-for-web.pptx_pages-to-jpg-0019.jpg\" alt=\"patient before and after Sofwave™ procedure\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"563\"></figure>\n</figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-7\">Frequently Asked Questions About Sofwave™</h2>\n\n\n<div>\n            \n<div id=\"faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"q-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-0\">\n\t\t\t\t<details><summary>How long does a Sofwave™ treatment take?</summary><div id=\"a-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-0\">\n\t\t\t\t<div><p>Sessions typically last 30 to 45 minutes.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div></details>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"q-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<details><summary>Is Sofwave™ painful?</summary><div id=\"a-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div><p>Most patients report mild warmth during treatment. Numbing cream is available if needed.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div></details>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"q-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-2\">\n\t\t\t\t<details><summary>When will I see results?</summary><div id=\"a-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-2\">\n\t\t\t\t<div><p>Initial results can appear within weeks, with full benefits visible after 3 months.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div></details>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"q-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<details><summary>How many treatments will I need?</summary><div id=\"a-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<div><p>Many patients achieve their goals with just one session, but Dr. Henson or Dr. Pargament may recommend additional treatments depending on your skin’s condition.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div></details>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"q-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<details><summary>Is Sofwave™ safe for all skin types?</summary><div id=\"a-faq-block_22dfe1e68794b1072e21a21000eefd0a-1900-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div><p>Yes, Sofwave™ is safe and effective across various skin tones and types.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div></details>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<h2 id=\"section-8\">Experience Sofwave™ Skin Tightening in Cincinnati and Dayton</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to smooth wrinkles, lift sagging skin, and restore a youthful glow – without surgery? <a href=\"#/contact/\">Schedule your Sofwave™ consultation</a> with Dr. Jonathan Pargament or Dr. Ginger Henson at AestheticEye. Our Cincinnati-based team offers personalized treatments to help you achieve natural-looking, long-lasting results.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Discover the power of ultrasound technology for skin tightening. Call today to get started!</p>\n"}